Project Title:
Decision Support System for Age-Related Macular Degeneration Using CNN

Objective:
To develop an automated system for classification of AMD and healthy retinal fundus images.

Method:
- Convolutional Neural Network (LeNet-based architecture)
- Image preprocessing and augmentation
- Training using MATLAB MatConvNet

Datasets:
- Local dataset (Iran University of Medical Sciences)
- STARE dataset

Results:
- Accuracy (Local dataset): 0.95
- Accuracy (STARE dataset): 0.81

Significance:
This work demonstrates the potential of deep learning for early detection of retinal diseases and supports clinical decision-making in ophthalmology.
